Z||000000||RaidenCobra||05-28-2001||10:15 PM||||I was talking with this guy that lives just down the street from me and he's selling his Fiero..  I asked him about all the options<BR>and this is what i know so far about it..<BR>It's a Gold 86GT, the paint is in Fair condition and the spoiler is faiding a bit..<BR>There's also a nice spot by the gas opening where the clear coat has chipped or something<BR>It's a 2.8  4 speed manual..  Options on it include, Rear defrost, power windows, tilt stearing, sun roof, no air no power locks<BR>and it has the delco deck with equilizer..<BR>I dont think it has premium speakers though<BR>there's 135 000kms on it and it's never winter driven.. He just replaced the clutch and the manifold gasket..<BR>What needs to be replaced is the rear tires, the fan upfront doesnt turn on so need that fixed (he says it never heats up past 100)<BR>and he says the shocks need to be replaced.<BR>Either the Front ones or both front and back<BR>not too sure!  <P>He is asking $4,500 CDN for it!<BR>Is this a deal or is it a rip off?<BR>Im working part time right now and im going to get another part time job (no longer in school) so i can afford it..  I will be using it as a daily driver and to travel about 125kms every weekend.<BR>The VIN is 1G2PG9797GP269928||||reg||1
